[911.020888, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[2D\u001b[5B\r\u001b[2C\u001b[46A\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Buser_impact:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  Introdu\u001b[13Ges\u001b[16Ga\u001b[18Gnew\u001b[22Gio.kestra.plugin.datagen.core.Anonymize\u001b[62Gtask\u001b[67Gthat\u001b[72Greads\u001b[78GCSV\u001b[82Gor\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BJSON fil\u001b[15G, replaces nominated fields with Datafaker-gener\u001b[64Gted f\u001b[70Gke v\u001b[75Glues, and\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bwrites the anonymized resul\u001b[33G back to internal storage. Closes a gap\u001b[73Gbetw\u001b[78Gen\u001b[81G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BGenerate (sy\u001b[18Gthet\u001b[23Gc from scratch)\u001b[39Gand real production data that\u001b[69Gmust be d\u001b[79G-identified\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bb\u001b[7Gfo\u001b[10Ge cro\u001b[16Gsing environ\u001b[29Gents.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Baffected_audience:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  - Data eng\u001b[16Gneers\u001b[22Gand\u001b[26Gplatform\u001b[35Gteams\u001b[41Grunning\u001b[49Gstaging/testing\u001b[65Gpipelines\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BCompliance teams subject to\u001b[35GGDPR,\u001b[41GCCPA, or sim\u001b[54Glar regulations\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BPlugin developers ext\u001b[29Gnding\u001b[35Gor composing datagen flows\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdoc_types:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  - Plugin\u001b[14Greference\u001b[24Gpage\u001b[29G(auto-generated\u001b[45G—\u001b[47Gcovered\u001b[55Gby\u001b[58G@Plugin/@Schema\u001b[74Gannotations)\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BOptio\u001b[13Gal n\u001b[18Gw how-to guide: \"Anonymize\u001b[45GPII fiel\u001b[54Gs in a Kestra pipeline\"\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcandidate_paths:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  - Auto-generated:\u001b[23Gkestra.io/plugins/plugin-datagen/tasks/core/anonymize\u001b[77G(from\u001b[83G@Plugin\u001b[91Gannotations)\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BOp\u001b[10Gional addition: ~/dev/docs/src\u001b[41Gconte\u001b[47Gts/docs/15.how-t\u001b[64G-guides/anonymize-pii/ (does \u001b[96G exist yet)\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BNo existing docs page references plugin-datagen at all (grep confirmed zero h\u001b[85Gts)\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Breasoning:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  - The plugin\u001b[18Greference\u001b[28Gpage\u001b[33Gis\u001b[36Gfully\u001b[42Gcovered:\u001b[51Gfour\u001b[56G@Example\u001b[65Gflows\u001b[71Gwith\u001b[76Gfull\u001b[81G=\u001b[83Gtrue,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gall\u001b[12Groperti\u001b[20Gs carry\u001b[28G@Schema, outputs a\u001b[48G ann\u001b[53Gtated. No manual docs work needed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GNo existing kestra.io docs page men\u001b[43Gions plugin-datagen\u001b[63Gor d\u001b[68Gta anonymization,\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gs\u001b[10Gnothing becomes stale or misleading after this PR merges.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GThe approved plan explicitly states \"No separate kestra.io docs\u001b[71GPR\u001b[74Grequired\u001b[83Gfor\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gt\u001b[9Gis issue.\"\u001b[20G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GA standalone\u001b[20Ghow-to\u001b[27Gguide\u001b[33Gcovering\u001b[42Ga\u001b[44GGDPR-safe\u001b[54Gpipeline\u001b[63G(generate\u001b[73G→\u001b[75Ganonymize\u001b[85G→\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gexport) w\u001b[17Guld impr\u001b[26Gve discoverability for compliance-oriented us\u001b[72Grs, but current\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bdocs are not wrong without it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bgaps_or_unknowns:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  - N\u001b[9G how-t\u001b[16G guide\u001b[23Gexists\u001b[30Gfor\u001b[34GDatafaker-based\u001b[50Ganonymization;\u001b[65Gif\u001b[68Ga\u001b[70G\"Data\u001b[76GPrivacy\"\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gor\u001b[10G\"GDPR-safe pipelines\" how-\u001b[37Go is plann\u001b[50Gfor the docs roadm\u001b[69Gp, this PR is the\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bnatural trigger.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GThe populate-demo-data\u001b[30Ghow-to\u001b[37G(docs/15.how-to-guides/populate-demo-data/)\u001b[81Gis\u001b[84Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u